			"description": "Pages the web server rendered, by route. `/(site)` is the landing page, `/[domain]/…` the pages of a portfolio (`/[domain]` also catches one-word addresses that are no portfolio). Counted where the pages are rendered, so crawlers and link previews are included. Traces can only be counted over 25 hours at a time: this panel always shows the last 24 hours.",
